      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Calculate what changed\nFor each measure, calculate:\nPercentage change = (current year − previous year) ÷ previous year × 100",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Calculate what changed\nFor each measure, calculate:\nPercentage change = (current year − previous year) ÷ previous year × 100",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bQNa_1TIqW2DhtBquc6DX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4778.600084073048,
      "y": 80410.04601196844,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 983224291,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 534305579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791197081342,
      "created": 1791196950262,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Build one yearly comparison\nFor each financial year, calculate:\n- Marketing spend: sum of amount.\n- Revenue: sum of gross_amount − discount_amount − refund_amount, using\ncompleted orders only.\n- Purchasing customers: distinct customers with completed orders.\nSummarise each file by year separately, then combine the summaries. This avoids\nrepeating marketing expenditure against every order.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Build one yearly comparison\nFor each financial year, calculate:\n- Marketing spend: sum of amount.\n- Revenue: sum of gross_amount − discount_amount − refund_amount, using completed orders only.\n- Purchasing customers: distinct customers with completed orders.\nSummarise each file by year separately, then combine the summaries. This avoids repeating marketing expenditure against every order.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
